sequenceDiagram
  participant A as ATM
  participant C as Capability API
  participant D as Device adapter
  participant L as Core ledger
  A->>C: Prepare already-authorized withdrawal
  C->>L: Commit command ID and keep hold
  A->>D: Dispense stable command ID
  Note over D: Cash outcome persists independently
  D--xA: Response lost
  A->>C: Query operation
  C-->>A: UNKNOWN, hold retained
  Note over A,D: Do not issue a new dispense ID
  A->>C: Reconcile same operation
  C->>D: Read final journal record
  C->>L: Post actual amount once and release hold
  C-->>A: Recorded final decision
